dio", "content": "engenn11le12ob11aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "leave no stone unturned"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to do everything possible"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to ensure that no stone is left unturned."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le12ob11aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to exceed expectations"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to do more than expected"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I really want to exceed expectations. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le12ob11aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to book"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to reserve"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'll be sure to book them both this week."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le12ob11aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "foot traffic"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "people who are moving from one place to another on foot; pedestrians"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: That should really help to clear out some of the foot traffic."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le12ob11aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "diligence"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "careful and persistent work"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm sure she will be very impressed with your diligence."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le12ob11aud09"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to swarm"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to move together as a group"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We want to ensure everyone isn't just swarming Marisa's table."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le12ob11aud10"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Will and Would to Express Intention or Willingness"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use <span class=italic>will </span>to talk about willingness or intention to do something. <br> You can also use <span class=italic>would </span>to talk about willingness."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you use would to talk about willingness or will to talk about willingness or intention, the context from the situation must be clear. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=italic>I'll text you when I arrive. </span>(intention)<br> <span class=italic>I'll translate for you - my Japanese is pretty good. </span>(willingness)<br> <span class=italic>Would you mind translating for me? </span>(willingness)<br> <span class=italic>No, I wouldn't mind doing that. </span>(willingness)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read the examples from the text. Keep the context in mind as you do."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'd be happy to give everything a once-over."}, {"type": "example", "content": "We really ought to come up with something to keep them entertained, especially since they will be expected to wait in line for hours. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "That would be excellent."}, {"type": "example", "content": "We should have games and activities set up for them, and I will be sure to get some form of entertainment. "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Purpose Clauses Including<span class=italic> In order to, for and so as to"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you want to talk about the purpose of something, you can use the phrases <span class=italic>in order/so as</span> + infinitive or<span class=italic> for."}, {"type": "text", "content": " Look at the chart for a review of these types of clauses:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  Phrase/Word\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Use/Form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=italic> in order/so as</span> + infinitive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to talk about the purpose of something<br> <br>     add <span class=italic>not </span>before the infinitive to make the sentence negative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=italic>They packed a lunch<span class=strong> in order to / so as to</span> avoid spending too much on the trip.<br> <br>   <span class=italic>They packed a lunch<span class=strong in order not to/so as not to</span> have to line up.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=italic>for\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to talk about the purpose of an action  (for + noun)<br><br>  to talk about the purpose of a thing  (for -ing)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=italic>I'm watching this for search purposes.<br><br>     <span class=italic>This is good for figuring out the needs of the company.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I could really use your help looking over the plans, in order to ensure that no stone is left unturned."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Perhaps we could have a little \u201cKid's Corner\u201d, so as to take some of the burden away from the parents. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Perhaps we should have a few different activities in order to keep them engaged. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "It occurred to me that we've got wine and food for the parents, but we have nothing for the kids. "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Imagine that a group of businesspeople will be visiting your hometown."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Research a number of social and cultural activities for them to do."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Create a one-week itinerary, outlining all of the things that they will see and do."}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I research social and cultural activities."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I plan future events."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I create an itinerary."}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"questions": [], "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can express willingness or intention to do something in work and job issues."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can express duty and advice related to work and job issues."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can request or report about the purpose of events or actions related to job issues."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Do you procrastinate, or do you get things done ahead of schedule? Provide examples."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " When you travel, do you prefer to plan ahead or to plan as you go? Explain your choice."}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct"}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": " Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": " Let's review!"}], "id": 0}, {"ques