l", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "id": 11}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn11le12ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "<span class=strong>Kristi:</span> Hi Adam. I'm just a little bit worried about the launch. I could really use your help looking over the plans, in order to ensure that no stone is left unturned.<br><span class=strong>Adam:</span> Not a problem at all. I'd be happy to give everything a once-over. Where should we start?<br><span class=strong>Kristi:</span> Well, we've got a good game plan, but I really want to exceed expectations. To start with, it occurred to me that we've got wine and food for the parents, but we have nothing for the kids. We really ought to come up with something to keep them entertained, especially since they will be expected to wait in line for hours. <br><span class=strong>Adam:</span> I agree. Perhaps we could have a little \u201cKid's Corner\u201d, so as to take some of the burden away from the parents.", "id": 1, "image": "engenn11le12ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "40000", "text": "<span class=strong>Kristi:</span> That would be excellent. We should have games and activities set up for them, and I will be sure to get some form of entertainment. Maybe a clown. <br><span class=strong>Adam:</span> That's a great idea. Perhaps we should have a few different activities in order to keep them engaged. I know at my nephew's birthday party, there was a guy making balloon animals and an artist drawing caricatures. <br><span class=strong>Kristi:</span> Good stuff. I'll be sure to book with them both this week. That ought to keep the children busy. Besides, our venue is a bookstore, so someone should be available to read stories as well.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn11le12ob11re2img06.jpg"}, {"time": "72000", "text": "<span class=strong>Adam:</span> Yeah, that should really help to clear out some of the foot traffic. We want to ensure everyone isn't just swarming Marisa's table. I really do think you've thought of just about every last detail, Kristi.<br/>\n<span class=strong>Kristi:</span> I know, I know. I just want to make sure I've gone over everything with a fine-tooth comb. I want to make Denise proud of me on this one, in order to have a better chance at landing a leading role on the next big project.\n<br>\n<span class=strong>Adam:</span> Well, I'm sure she will be very impressed with your diligence. You've done a great job.<br><span class=strong>Kristi:</span> Thanks, Adam. I certainly hope so.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn11le12ob11re2img07.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le12ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le12ob11re2img05.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": [], "title": ""}], "id": 0}]}